<title>UK: German inland gas oil steady, trade inactive.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil steady, trade inactive.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.8364)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     34.60/35.00     18.84/19.05   34.60/35.00</p>
<p> BREMEN		34.60/35.00     18.84/19.05   34.60/35.00</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    34.80/35.20     18.95/19.16   34.80/35.20</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   35.50/35.90     19.33/19.54   35.50/35.90</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   35.60/36.00     19.38/19.60   35.60/36.00</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  36.90/37.30     20.09/20.31   36.90/37.30</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices were around unchanged in mid-afternoon in a slow market depressed by further advances in the dollar, which touched a six-year high of 1.8405 marks before slipping to 1.8364 marks. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
